, "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 5, "type": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAImageReference", "title": "Image Reference", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAImageReference"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "target", "slot_index": 0, "links": [11, 12], "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "shape_info", "slot_index": 1, "links": [], "label": "shape_info", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "shape_info"}], "size": [380, 204], "pos": [124.01046752929688, -162.55865478515625], "widgets_values": ["16:9", 15, 832, 480], "inputs": [{"name": "references", "link": 7, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration_seconds"}, "name": "duration_seconds", "label": "duration_seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration_seconds"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "shape": 7, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "shape": 7, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VATarget", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VATarget"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "slot_index": 0, "links": [14], "label": "conditioning", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}], "size": [377.5902404785156, 522.2068481445312], "pos": [593.977294921875, -113.71315002441406], "widgets_values": ["MiniMax H3｜15s 图生视频提示词\n\n参考锁定：\n@图1 锁定亚洲年轻女性模特的脸型、五官、发型与整体气质；\n@图2 锁定紫色耳夹式耳机及充电盒的真实外观、颜色、结构、比例，不增加或改变任何零件；\n@图3 锁定耳机真实佩戴方式、耳机与耳朵之间的位置关系和大小比例；\n@图4 锁定极简高级白色室内空间，圆弧建筑结构、柔和自然光、干净高级的消费电子广告氛围。\n\n15秒视频：\n0–3s，镜头从@图4极简白色空间缓慢向前推进，@图1模特自然走入画面，柔和侧光照亮面部，整体白色与浅灰高级商业摄影质感。\n3–6s，切换到耳部高清微距特写，模特轻轻整理头发露出耳朵，严格按照@图3的方式佩戴@图2紫色耳机，镜头轻微环绕耳部，突出小巧圆润的耳夹结构与紫色光泽，耳机尺寸、结构绝对不能变化。\n6–9s，产品英雄镜头，@图2紫色充电盒悬浮于干净白色空间中缓慢旋转，充电盒自然打开，两只耳机保持真实结构排列，柔和高光沿产品轮廓移动，表现精致材质，不产生多余耳机、不改变颜色和结构。\n9–12s，回到模特半侧脸近景，模特佩戴耳机轻微转头、自然微笑，镜头从耳部缓慢拉至半身，背景保持@图4空间，浅景深，突出耳机与人物的精致搭配。\n12–15s，耳部超高清特写与完整产品快速柔和转场，最后定格为模特佩戴耳机的高级侧脸特写，紫色耳机清晰处于视觉中心，背景柔焦，干净收尾。\n\n全程要求：\n真实商业广告摄影，人物自然真实，皮肤细节真实，高级柔光，镜头运动稳定克制；严格保持@图2产品颜色、形状、结构、比例和左右耳一致性，严格按照@图3佩戴方式；禁止耳机变形、变色、变大变小、穿模、漂浮、增加装饰、增加灯光；画面不出现任何文字、字幕、Logo、参数或UI。\n\n中文口播，年轻温柔女声，清晰自然、有轻奢感：\n“轻轻一戴，自在随行。精巧耳夹设计，贴合耳畔，让音乐融入每一个自在时刻。”\n\n背景音乐：\n轻奢时尚电子音乐，约105–110 BPM，清透柔和的电子鼓点＋空气感合成器＋细腻钢琴点缀，前段轻盈，中段随产品特写略微增强，最后2秒柔和收束；口播期间BGM自动降低约5dB，配合轻微whoosh转场音和精致产品提示音，不使用人声歌曲。", "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_text_encoder", "link": 9, "label": "h3_text_encoder", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TEXT_ENCODER", "localized_name": "h3_text_encoder"}, {"name": "h3_vae_bundle", "link": 10, "label": "h3_vae_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_VAE_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "h3_vae_bundle"}, {"name": "target", "link": 11, "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "references", "link": 8, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "ref_image_size"}, "shape": 7, "name": "ref_image_size", "label": "ref_image_size", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ref_image_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHMiniMaxH3Ref2VAEncode"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video_url", "label": "video_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "video_url"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [318.3470458984375, 420.6941223144531], "pos": [1483.85693359375, 239.0325469970703], "widgets_values": ["minimax_h3/ref2va_image", "mp4", "h264", "